/* Theme is driven by data-theme on <html>, set before paint by the inline
 * script in index.html and kept in sync by App.tsx. The preference may be
 * light, dark, or system; "system" is resolved to a concrete light/dark value
 * in JS, so the CSS only ever sees "light" or "dark" here. */
